@host = https://localhost:7150

### Lista proizvoda
GET {{host}}/api/products
Accept: application/json

### Jedan proizvod
GET {{host}}/api/products/1
Accept: application/json

### Nepostojeci proizvod -> 404
GET {{host}}/api/products/999
Accept: application/json

### Neispravan id -> 404 vec od rutiranja ({id:int})
GET {{host}}/api/products/abc
Accept: application/json
